Fault set:
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{F} = \{ f_k \mid k = 1,\dots,N_f \}.
\end{equation}

Mean time to self-correction:
\begin{equation}
\text{MTS}
=
\frac{1}{N_f}
\sum_{k}
\left(
t^{(k)}_{\text{recovered}}
-
t^{(k)}_{\text{fault}}
\right).
\end{equation}

Zero-knowledge invariant success rate:
\begin{equation}
R_{\text{ZK}}
=
\frac{N_{\text{ZK, passed}}}{N_{\text{ZK, total}}},
\quad
R_{\text{ZK}} = 1.0.
\end{equation}

